Package: naturetools
Type: Package
Title: Extra tools for working with NatureCounts and other observations-based data sets
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Birds Canada", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "dethier@birdscanada.org"),
    person("Steffi", "LaZerte", email = "sel@steffilazerte.ca", role = c("aut"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7690-8360")),
    person("Rory", "Macklin", email = "rmacklin@birdscanada.org", role = c("aut")),
    person("Danielle", "Ethier", email = "dethier@birdscanada.org", role = c("aut")))
Description: Extra tools for working with data on plant and animal populations, 
    such as those from NatureCounts, a service managed by Birds Canada.
    Includes COSEWIC Index of Area of Occupancy (IAO) and Extent of Occurrence 
    (EOO) calculations as well as adding environmental covariates.
